    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 19,
      "x": 65,
      "y": 395,
      "width": 299.9497985839844,
      "height": 125,
      "strokeColor": "#7ee787",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "_build_token_trie(functions, model)\n→ (root: TrieNode, mapping: dict)\n\nEncodes each function name → token IDs\nBuilds a trie path per name\nStores (token_ids → name) for reverse lookup\n\nExample: fn_add_numbers might tokenize as [1042, 856, 15]\nEdges: root → node(1042) → node(856) → node(15,\nterminal=True)",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "id": "MwvtdKwc",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "elementType": "text",
      "containerId": "box_build_trie",
      "originalText": "_build_token_trie(functions, model)\n→ (root: TrieNode, mapping: dict)\n\nEncodes each function name → token IDs\nBuilds a trie path per name\nStores (token_ids → name) for reverse lookup\n\nExample: fn_add_numbers might tokenize as [1042, 856, 15]\nEdges: root → node(1042) → node(856) → node(15, terminal=True)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "versionNonce": 400603925,
      "index": "a7",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 16,
