    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 35,
      "x": 65,
      "y": 545,
      "width": 309.039794921875,
      "height": 200,
      "strokeColor": "#7ee787",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "select_function_name(model, prompt, functions) → str\n\n1. Builds a prompt: \"You are a function selector.\" + available\nfunctions\n2. Encodes prompt → token IDs via model.encode()\n3. Builds token trie from function names\n4. **Generation loop**:\n   a. Get logits for next token from model\n   b. Restrict candidates to children of current trie node\n   c. Pick highest-logit token via _select_max_logit\n   d. Traverse trie to child node\n   e. If terminal and no more children → STOP\n5. Reverse-lookup token IDs → function name via mapping dict\n\n🔑 This physically CANNOT generate an invalid function name.\nThe trie constrains the model's output space.",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "id": "jX3rlHjM",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "elementType": "text",
      "containerId": "box_select_fn",
      "originalText": "select_function_name(model, prompt, functions) → str\n\n1. Builds a prompt: \"You are a function selector.\" + available functions\n2. Encodes prompt → token IDs via model.encode()\n3. Builds token trie from function names\n4. **Generation loop**:\n   a. Get logits for next token from model\n   b. Restrict candidates to children of current trie node\n   c. Pick highest-logit token via _select_max_logit\n   d. Traverse trie to child node\n   e. If terminal and no more children → STOP\n5. Reverse-lookup token IDs → function name via mapping dict\n\n🔑 This physically CANNOT generate an invalid function name.\nThe trie constrains the model's output space.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "versionNonce": 2103549397,
      "index": "a9",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
