    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 79,
      "x": 425,
      "y": 567.530766,
      "width": 323.8997802734375,
      "height": 212.5,
      "strokeColor": "#ffa657",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "_generate_parameters(prompt, function_def) → dict\n\n**Deterministic regex extraction** — NO LLM call!\n\nDelegates each string param to _extract_string_param(),\nwhich uses **parameter name keywords** to pick the right regex:\n\nParameter name → extraction strategy:\n  \"name\" + desc has person/greeting → greet <Name> from prompt\n  source_string / source / input    → in \"...\" / in '...'\n  regex / pattern / re              → word '...' / replace all ...\n  replacement / replace             → with '...'\n  (fallback)                        → positional quoted / alpha tokens\n\nNumbers → positional.  Booleans → keyword presence.\nNo function names are hardcoded — works with any schema.",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "id": "dV7jL2ci",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "elementType": "text",
      "containerId": "box_gen_params",
      "originalText": "_generate_parameters(prompt, function_def) → dict\n\n**Deterministic regex extraction** — NO LLM call!\n\nDelegates each string param to _extract_string_param(),\nwhich uses **parameter name keywords** to pick the right regex:\n\nParameter name → extraction strategy:\n  \"name\" + desc has person/greeting → greet <Name> from prompt\n  source_string / source / input    → in \"...\" / in '...'\n  regex / pattern / re              → word '...' / replace all ...\n  replacement / replace             → with '...'\n  (fallback)                        → positional quoted / alpha tokens\n\nNumbers → positional.  Booleans → keyword presence.\nNo function names are hardcoded — works with any schema.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "versionNonce": 566714549,
      "index": "aB",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
