    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 247,
      "x": 79.1030156902799,
      "y": 796.6036119109278,
      "width": 267.5298767089844,
      "height": 150,
      "strokeColor": "#f0f6fc",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "decode(*, model, prompt, functions) → DecodedCall\n\nThe public API — called by pipeline.py\n\n1. name = select_function_name(...)     ← LLM + trie\n2. function_def = find by name\n3. parameters = _generate_parameters(...)  ← regex\n4. return {\"name\": name, \"parameters\": parameters}\n\n✨ The 2-phase approach:\nPhase 1 (LLM): pick which function\nPhase 2 (regex): extract parameters deterministically",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "id": "7kjjJ0Zm",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "elementType": "text",
      "containerId": "box_decode",
      "originalText": "decode(*, model, prompt, functions) → DecodedCall\n\nThe public API — called by pipeline.py\n\n1. name = select_function_name(...)     ← LLM + trie\n2. function_def = find by name\n3. parameters = _generate_parameters(...)  ← regex\n4. return {\"name\": name, \"parameters\": parameters}\n\n✨ The 2-phase approach:\nPhase 1 (LLM): pick which function\nPhase 2 (regex): extract parameters deterministically",
      "autoResize": true,
